### Get all cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### Get one cat by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/9592

### Add a new cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cat_name": "Luna",
  "weight": 4,
  "owner": 3609,
  "filename": "luna123",
  "birthdate": "2023-05-20"
}

### Get all cats again
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### Update a cat
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/9592

### Delete a cat
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/9592
